      "content": "i checked the basic history but it doesnt show much, just 'temp adjusted'. i'm worried it's my ex... he was always so tech savvy and used to mess with things just to get a reaction out of me. if he's doing this, he's probably using a workaround so it doesn't show up as a 'login' in the main app. is there a way to look for more specific patterns? like, if the lights change color, could that actually be a signal or some kind of code he's using to mess with my head?",
